{%- from 'macros.j2' import cell -%}
{%- macro findings(entries) %}
{% for entry in entries %}
{% if loop.first %}

| Check | Description | Nodes |
| --- | --- | --- |
{% endif %}
| {{ entry.id }} | {{ cell(entry.text) }} | {{ entry.nodes | join(', ') }} |
{% else %}

None.
{% endfor %}
{% endmacro -%}
# CIS benchmark summary: {{ cis_cluster }}

| Field | Value |
| --- | --- |
| Cluster | {{ cell(cis_cluster) }} |
| Kubernetes version | {{ kubernetes_version }} |
| Benchmark | {{ cis_resolved_benchmark }} |
| Fallback | {{ (cis_kubernetes_minor ~ ' is not mapped by the profiles: it fell back to ' ~ cis_fallback_version) if cis_fallback_version else 'none' }} |
| kube-bench version | {{ cis_kube_bench_version }} |
| Profiles source | {{ cis_profiles_source_repo }} |
| Profiles commit | `{{ cis_profiles_source_commit }}` |
| Date (UTC) | {{ cis_run_date }} |

