| Result | Count |
| --- | --- |
| Nodes with a result | {{ cis_report.nodes | rejectattr('error') | list | length }} of {{ cis_report.nodes | length }} |
| PASS | {{ cis_report.totals.pass }} |
| FAIL | {{ cis_report.totals.fail }} |
| WARN | {{ cis_report.totals.warn }} |
| INFO | {{ cis_report.totals.info }} |
